# Build & dependencies
/node_modules
/dist
/build
*.tsbuildinfo
web/node_modules
web/dist

# Generated
/migrations/data/temp/

# Written by `createSwaggerConfig` on every local boot, from a build that applies the
# `@nestjs/swagger` CLI plugin. The document the SPA's types are generated from is the committed
# `web/src/api/openapi.json`, emitted by `npm run openapi:generate`; keeping this local-boot copy
# tracked would make the two overwrite each other in turn.
/openapi.json

# Logs
logs
*.log

# The benchmark eval lane (`eval/run.ts`'s `--lane benchmark`) runs against a corpus outside the
# synthetic fixtures under `fixtures/data-room/` — its cache and results are excluded wholesale, not
# by file extension, so a cache entry or a results row that embeds a client document's content can
# never reach a commit even if the lane's directory layout changes later.
/eval/benchmark/

# Eval results recorded against a dirty working tree. `eval/run.ts` names its output by git sha and
# suffixes `-dirty` when the tree has uncommitted changes, so every run during development writes a
# file into this otherwise-committed directory. Three such recordings had accumulated and one was
# being cited by a walkthrough as if it were current — the suffix marks provenance as untrustworthy,
# which is exactly what should never be committed. Clean-sha results stay tracked deliberately.
/eval/results/*-dirty.json
/eval/results/*-dirty.md

# The public eval lane (`eval/run.ts`'s `--lane public`) fetches SEC EDGAR filings and ingests them
# through the eval harness path — the fetched bytes, the XBRL companyfacts JSON, the ingest ledger
# and every cache entry are excluded wholesale, the same confidentiality-boundary shape as the
# benchmark lane above, so a re-fetch or a re-record can never land fetched filing content or a
# model-response fixture in git history. Dataset, manifests and clean-sha results stay tracked
# deliberately — the claims rewrite cites them.
/eval/public/corpus/
/eval/public/cache/
/eval/public/results/*-dirty.json
/eval/public/results/*-dirty.md
/eval/public/results/verifier/**/cache/

