# AI assistants
.serena/*
# .claude/ is committed on purpose — the rules, contexts, skills and project-discovery.json
# are shared project configuration, useless if they only exist on one machine. Machine-local
# and regenerable scratch files are excluded by .claude/.gitignore instead of a blanket ignore.
